Package: tensorflow-termux
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: glibc-repo, glibc-runner, python-glibc, python-pip-glibc
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: TensorFlow for Termux (CPU, via termux-glibc)
 Termux (bionic) has no TensorFlow wheels; the PyPI manylinux aarch64
 wheels need glibc. This installs termux-glibc, a glibc Python 3.12 and
 TensorFlow into it (~300 MB wheel plus dependencies, downloaded during
 install). python3 (bionic) cannot import tensorflow - use tf-python.
 Commands: tf-python, tensorflow-check, tensorflow-setup.
 Set TF_SKIP_SETUP=1 during apt install to skip the download (run
 tensorflow-setup later); TF_VERSION=2.21.0 pins the TensorFlow version.
